  "description": "Web App specific extensions for Blazouter routing library. This package provides the necessary components and integration for Blazor Web App applications (.NET 8+) that support both Server and WebAssembly render modes (Auto/Interactive). Enables React Router-like routing features in the unified Blazor Web App model with full support for nested routes, guards, lazy loading, and smooth transitions. Works seamlessly with InteractiveServer, InteractiveWebAssembly, and InteractiveAuto render modes.",
